   {
    "h": "Etymology",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "The specific name, tolampyae, may refer to Ambatolampy, a city in Madagascar. Grandidier gave no explanation."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "Habitat",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "The preferred natural habitat of L. tolampyae is forest, at altitudes from sea level to 1,600 m (5,200 ft)."
    ]
   },
